* Logic gate and buffer cores (project-authored, simplified): input stages, one XSPICE d_* gate and an output stage.
* Parameters: LO/HI/RK/AK input thresholds (see io.lib), VOLF/VOHF output levels as fractions of the supply, ROUT output
* impedance, TPD the gate delay of the code model (the input and output bridges add about 2*TD), TD bridge delay.
* The defaults describe the 74HC family at 5 V.
.subckt bench_d_nand2 vc gn a b y params: LO=0.45 HI=0.55 RK=1 AK=0 VOLF=0 VOHF=1 ROUT=45 TPD=9n TD=1n
Xa vc gn a da bench_din LO={LO} HI={HI} RK={RK} AK={AK} TD={TD}
Xb vc gn b db bench_din LO={LO} HI={HI} RK={RK} AK={AK} TD={TD}
A1 [da db] dy g
.model g d_nand(rise_delay={TPD} fall_delay={TPD})
Xo vc gn dy y bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
.ends bench_d_nand2
.subckt bench_d_nor2 vc gn a b y params: LO=0.45 HI=0.55 RK=1 AK=0 VOLF=0 VOHF=1 ROUT=45 TPD=9n TD=1n
Xa vc gn a da bench_din LO={LO} HI={HI} RK={RK} AK={AK} TD={TD}
Xb vc gn b db bench_din LO={LO} HI={HI} RK={RK} AK={AK} TD={TD}
A1 [da db] dy g
.model g d_nor(rise_delay={TPD} fall_delay={TPD})
Xo vc gn dy y bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
.ends bench_d_nor2
.subckt bench_d_and2 vc gn a b y params: LO=0.45 HI=0.55 RK=1 AK=0 VOLF=0 VOHF=1 ROUT=45 TPD=9n TD=1n
Xa vc gn a da bench_din LO={LO} HI={HI} RK={RK} AK={AK} TD={TD}
Xb vc gn b db bench_din LO={LO} HI={HI} RK={RK} AK={AK} TD={TD}
A1 [da db] dy g
.model g d_and(rise_delay={TPD} fall_delay={TPD})
Xo vc gn dy y bench_dout VOLF={VOLF} VOHF={VOHF} ROUT={ROUT} TD={TD}
.ends bench_d_and2
